      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Exchange breakdown (US Equities pack)**\n\n| Exchange | Total stocks in pack | In top 500 most liquid | In top 50 most liquid |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| CBOE | 1 | 1 | 0 |\n| NYSE | 715 | 327 | 26 |\n| Nasdaq | 862 | 172 | 24 |\n| OTC | 23 | 0 | 0 |\n\n*Source: Auto Ontology query on the `assets` table, using the pre-computed `liquidity_rank` (rank 1 = highest median daily dollar volume). The pack contains 1,601 stocks total.* [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — us_equities — evidence `hermes-receipt:22654ce8d237e0bba070f720b89c429e21a44bf09cbac16064a07024d94acc5c`",
