          "content": {
            "query": "For each exchange, count: 1) total stocks in the pack, 2) how many of the top 500 most liquid stocks (by median daily dollar volume) are listed on that exchange, and 3) how many of the top 50 most liquid stocks are listed on that exchange. Sort by exchange name.",
            "databaseName": "us_equities",
            "answer": "This query lists each exchange and shows three counts: the total number of stocks listed on that exchange, how many of those stocks are among the top 500 most liquid by median daily dollar volume, and how many are among the top 50 most liquid. It uses the pre‑computed liquidity_rank in the assets table to identify the top stocks, groups the results by exchange, and sorts them alphabetically by exchange name.",
            "sql": "SELECT a.exchange, COUNT(*) AS total_stocks, SUM(CASE WHEN a.liquidity_rank <= 500 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS top_500_count, SUM(CASE WHEN a.liquidity_rank <= 50 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS top_50_count FROM us_equities.main.assets AS a GROUP BY a.exchange ORDER BY a.exchange;",
